45 780 Td
(   monitors, paper triage charts, surgical scalpels, and mobile laptop stands \(COWs\).) Tj
T*
(   - Users: Attending trauma surgeons, registered nurses, respiratory therapists, terrified family) Tj
T*
(   members, and critically injured, non-communicative trauma patients.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Engineering & Design Insights Derived:) Tj
T*
(   - Barcode scanners frequently fail under blood and fluid smudges \(Object failure\); high ambient) Tj
T*
(   noise masks auditory pump alarms \(Environment-Interaction mismatch\), demonstrating the critical) Tj
T*
(   need for multi-sensory visual heads-up displays and ruggedized tactile hardware.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
