(   [Problem Statement]: Contrast 'Explicit Needs' with 'Implicit / Latent Needs'. Detail how discovering latent needs through ethnographic shadowing leads to disruptive product breakthroughs, using Intuit's 'Follow Me Home' program.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Conceptual Taxonomy of User Needs:) Tj
T*
(   - Explicit Needs: Articulated requirements that users can readily verbalize, measure, and) Tj
T*
(   request \(e.g., 'I need a button to calculate sales tax faster'\).) Tj
T*
(   - Implicit / Latent Needs: Deep, unarticulated desires and frustrations that users cannot) Tj
T*
(   express because they have grown habituated to systemic pain or cannot imagine a radically) Tj
T*
(   different technological paradigm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Intuit's 'Follow Me Home' Ethnographic Program:) Tj
T*
(   - Pioneered by Intuit founder Scott Cook, software engineers and product managers physically) Tj
T*
(   accompanied small business owners to their offices and homes to observe how they managed) Tj
T*
(   finances.) Tj
T*
(   - Observations: Researchers observed small business owners diligently entering transactions) Tj
T*
(   into QuickBooks, but noticed a stack of crumpled paper receipts, shoeboxes, and physical paper) Tj
T*
(   checks sitting beside the keyboard.) Tj
T*
(   - The Latent Discovery: Users did not want a faster accounting ledger \(explicit need\); they) Tj
T*
(   dreaded the manual bookkeeping entirely. Their latent need was automated financial peace of) Tj
T*
(   mind.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Disruptive Breakthroughs Derived:) Tj
T*
(   - Intuit developed automated bank feed synchronization and snap-to-reconcile mobile photo) Tj
T*
(   receipt capture, eliminating manual data entry completely.) Tj
T*
(   - Had Intuit relied solely on customer surveys \(explicit requests\), they would have built) Tj
T*
(   faster spreadsheet tables, leaving the shoebox problem untouched.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
