/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the step-by-step process of constructing an empirical, research-grounded 'User Persona'. How do teams prevent personas from devolving into fictional caricatures and stereotypes?) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Step-by-Step Empirical Persona Construction:) Tj
T*
(   - Step 1: Collect Multi-Source Qualitative Data: Conduct 15-20 contextual inquiry interviews,) Tj
T*
(   ethnographic observations, and field notes across diverse user cohorts.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 2: Identify Behavioral Variables: Map participants across 10-15 behavioral continuums) Tj
T*
(   \(e.g., Technical Proficiency: Novice vs. Expert; Risk Tolerance: Conservative vs.) Tj
T*
(   Experimental\).) Tj
T*
(   - Step 3: Cluster Across Continuum Patterns: Identify distinct groups of participants who) Tj
T*
(   consistently cluster together across multiple variables. Each distinct cluster forms the) Tj
T*
(   nucleus of a persona archetype.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 4: Synthesize Goals, Motivations, and Frustrations: Extract authentic behavioral goals,) Tj
T*
(   environmental constraints, mental models, and pain points directly from interview transcripts.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 5: Draft the Persona Artifact: Compile demographics \(photo, archetype name\), narrative) Tj
T*
(   scenario, primary goals, acute pain points, and quote.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Preventing Caricatures and Stereotyping:) Tj
T*
(   - Avoid Fictional Fluff: Eliminate irrelevant personal trivia \(e.g., 'Likes long walks on the) Tj
T*
(   beach and owns a golden retriever'\) that clutters the document without informing technical) Tj
T*
(   architecture.) Tj
T*
(   - Ground Every Claim in Verifiable Quotes: Annotate persona attributes with citations pointing) Tj
T*
(   directly to field interview transcripts and telemetry logs.) Tj
T*
(   - Design for Mindsets, Not Demographics: Grouping users by age, gender, or race introduces) Tj
T*
(   dangerous stereotyping. Grouping by cognitive workflows, technical comfort, and operational) Tj
T*
(   goals yields robust, actionable engineering direction.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

