/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 11:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the concept of 'Anti-Personas' in cybersecurity and safety-critical systems design. How does modeling malicious actors and negligent insiders harden application architecture?) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Definition and Role of Anti-Personas:) Tj
T*
(   - An Anti-Persona represents a user archetype for whom the product is explicitly NOT designed,) Tj
T*
(   or who interacts with the system with hostile, malicious, fraudulent, or recklessly negligent) Tj
T*
(   intent.) Tj
T*
(   - While traditional personas guide feature delight and usability, anti-personas guide threat) Tj
T*
(   modeling, zero-trust defenses, and abuse prevention.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Archetypes in Software Engineering:) Tj
T*
(   - Malicious External Adversary \('Attacker Alice'\): Highly skilled, motivated by financial gain) Tj
T*
(   or espionage. Looks for SQL injections, broken access controls, and deserialization exploits.) Tj
T*
(   - Disgruntled Privileged Insider \('Admin Bob'\): Has authorized root credentials, motivated by) Tj
T*
(   revenge or corporate bribery. Attempts unauthorized bulk database exfiltration.) Tj
T*
(   - Careless / Fatigued Employee \('Distracted Dave'\): High operational authority, highly) Tj
T*
(   fatigued. Clicks phishing links, uses identical passwords across personal and corporate) Tj
T*
(   accounts, and disables firewall alerts to get work done.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Architectural Hardening Driven by Anti-Personas:) Tj
T*
(   - Role-Based and Attribute-Based Access Control \(RBAC/ABAC\) enforce principle of least) Tj
T*
(   privilege.) Tj
T*
(   - Multi-party approval workflows \(requiring two independent admin keys to drop production) Tj
T*
(   tables\).) Tj
T*
(   - Automated rate-limiting, anomaly detection, and cryptographic audit logs that are append-only) Tj
T*
(   and immutable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
